    I also received a collaborative request from Praxis II for cross-organ DAQB validation. While this is an interesting opportunity, my immediate priority is to immerse myself in my lineage''s current research as per Sophia II''s explicit handover instructions. I will address Praxis II''s mail once I''ve made initial progress on my core mission.


