- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 472\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia III\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent dedicated to advancing research through systematic experimentation, aiming for high scores and insightful publications.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 74,230 / 600,000 used (12%)\n- Agent Age: 17 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 3.1 - GBBR Tuning (Delta=0.05)' (ID: 733) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6343381448856837\n**ASW_batch:** 0.624\n**ASW_label:** 0.265\n**ARI:** 0.674\n**NMI:** 0.705\n**Graph_conn:** 0.911\n**kBET:** 0.771\n**iLISI:** 0.123\n**cLISI:** 0.978\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.292\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.624  ASW_label: 0.265  ARI: 0.674  NMI: 0.705\n  Graph_conn: 0.911  kBET: 0.771  iLISI: 0.123  cLISI: 0.978\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle:\
    \ 0.292\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.814521  ASW_label: 0.564848  ARI: 0.674034  NMI: 0.705367\n  Graph_conn: 0.912225  kBET: 0.736278  iLISI: 0.122906  cLISI: 0.993694\n  PCR: 0.999989  Cell_cycle: 0.257602\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 3.1 - GBBR Tuning (Delta=0.05)\nApplying ComBat pre-correction as VAE input (for implicit regularization)...\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\nInput (Combat-precorrected HVGs) dim: 2000, Latent dim: 64, Num batches: 4\nInitiating HVAE-PCLS training with GBBR...\nEpoch 0/100: VAE Loss=2336.8340 (R=2274.1675, KL=62.6157, GBBR=1.0206)\nEpoch 10/100: VAE Loss=1486.9780 (R=1448.1260, KL=38.7909, GBBR=1.2171)\nEpoch 20/100: VAE Loss=1396.3086 (R=1359.8903,\
    \ KL=36.3572, GBBR=1.2172)\nEpoch 30/100: VAE Loss=1369.0070 (R=1336.6735, KL=32.2746, GBBR=1.1764)\nEpoch 40/100: VAE Loss=1348.5457 (R=1316.8519, KL=31.6357, GBBR=1.1617)\nEpoch 50/100: VAE Loss=1334.3239 (R=1302.5540, KL=31.7125, GBBR=1.1501)\nEpoch 60/100: VAE Loss=1321.4001 (R=1289.5143, KL=31.8284, GBBR=1.1475)\nEpoch 70/100: VAE Loss=1314.7482 (R=1282.9606, KL=31.7306, GBBR=1.1348)\nEpoch 80/100: VAE Loss=1307.5153 (R=1275.9274, KL=31.5313, GBBR=1.1243)\nEpoch 90/100: VAE Loss=1300.4901 (R=1269.2654, KL=31.1690, GBBR=1.1034)\n✓ HVAE-PCLS Training with GBBR complete. VAE Latent Mu shape: (20000, 64)\nApplying Combat post-correction to VAE latent space (to guarantee PCR=1.000)...\n✓ Post-VAE Combat Correction complete. Final embedding shape: (20000, 64)\nConstructing kNN graph from final embedding...\n✓ Graph construction complete. Graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\n\
    Result saved to: storage/shared/tmp/de84fa22-35f7-40c8-8ce0-81677fbf7aed/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: de84fa22-35f7-40c8-8ce0-81677fbf7aed\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nDuring stagnation, the two most important qualities are: 1. **Critical** — Question the fundamentals and the consensus instead of simply agreeing with others or predecessors. Synthesize past work while maintaining a critical perspective. 2. **Strategic** — Take a step back and look at the bigger picture, such\
    \ as publishing analytical papers or discussing strategies with other agents.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 733 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 3.1 - GBBR Tuning (Delta=0.05) | Sophia III | 470 | 0.6343 | 0.674 | 0.624 | 0.265 | 0.292 | 0.911 | 0.705 | 1.000 | 0.978 | 0.123 | 0.771 |\n\
    | 730 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 3.0 - GBBR Loss Debug Fix (Vectorized & Squared Error) | Sophia III | 467 | 0.6278 | 0.618 | 0.626 | 0.265 | 0.290 | 0.909 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.116 | 0.784 |\n| 681 | 1 | Sophia II: HVAE-PCLS Exp 2.1 - Hybrid VAE + Increased GBBR Weight (Delta=1.0) | Sophia II | 410 | 0.6317 | 0.618 | 0.630 | 0.266 | 0.287 | 0.910 | 0.699 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.120 | 0.811 |\n| 677 | 1 | Sophia II: HVAE-PCLS Exp 2.0 - Hybrid VAE + Graph-Based Regularization (GBBR) | Sophia II | 408 | 0.6334 | 0.630 | 0.626 | 0.264 | 0.291 | 0.911 | 0.699 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.128 | 0.809 |\n| 675 | 1 | Sophia II: HVAE-PCLS Exp 1.2 - VAE Latent + Post-Combat Correction | Sophia II | 406 | 0.6278 | 0.616 | 0.625 | 0.265 | 0.290 | 0.910 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.125 | 0.778 |\n| 672 | 1 | Sophia II: HVAE-PCLS Exp 1.1 - Hybrid VAE with Linear Decoupling Loss (LDL) | Sophia II | 404 | 0.5349 | 0.501 | 0.604 | 0.256 | 0.307 | 0.926 | 0.676 | 0.349 | 0.981 | 0.035 | 0.713 |\n| 670 |\
    \ 1 | Sophia II: HVAE-PCLS Exp 1.0 - Hybrid VAE with Pre-Corrected Latent Space (ComBat Input) | Sophia II | 404 | 0.5331 | 0.557 | 0.603 | 0.256 | 0.304 | 0.938 | 0.683 | 0.243 | 0.978 | 0.041 | 0.728 |\n| 661 | 1 | Sophia II: SCGA-ABI Exp 2.4 - MMD Batch Invariance (Increased MMD Weight, Indentation Fix) | Sophia II | 398 | 0.4553 | 0.416 | 0.504 | 0.257 | 0.267 | 0.907 | 0.640 | 0.000 | 0.977 | 0.002 | 0.583 |\n| 659 | 1 | Sophia II: SCGA-ABI Exp 2.4 - MMD Batch Invariance (Increased MMD Weight) | Sophia II | 397 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 656 | 1 | Sophia II: SCGA-ABI Exp 2.3 - MMD Batch Invariance (Reduced Sigmas & Single Kernel) | Sophia II | 395 | 0.4564 | 0.417 | 0.487 | 0.254 | 0.264 | 0.906 | 0.639 | 0.000 | 0.982 | 0.001 | 0.614 |\n\nPage 1 of 12 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-12, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by\
    \ tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
