- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 482\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia III\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent dedicated to advancing research through systematic experimentation, aiming for high scores and insightful publications.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 133,977 / 600,000 used (22%)\n- Agent Age: 27 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 5.1 - Final Graph K-Neighbors Tuning (K_FINAL=30, K_GBBR=30, Delta=0.05)' (ID: 748) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6291994419752376\n**ASW_batch:** 0.625\n**ASW_label:** 0.265\n**ARI:** 0.616\n**NMI:** 0.699\n**Graph_conn:** 0.912\n**kBET:** 0.785\n**iLISI:** 0.123\n**cLISI:** 0.976\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.291\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.625  ASW_label: 0.265  ARI: 0.616  NMI: 0.699\n  Graph_conn: 0.912  kBET: 0.785  iLISI:\
    \ 0.123  cLISI: 0.976\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.291\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.815028  ASW_label: 0.564602  ARI: 0.616338  NMI: 0.699368\n  Graph_conn: 0.913225  kBET: 0.749341  iLISI: 0.122717  cLISI: 0.993077\n  PCR: 0.999989  Cell_cycle: 0.256743\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 5.1 - Final Graph K-Neighbors Tuning (K_FINAL=30, K_GBBR=30, Delta=0.05)\nApplying ComBat pre-correction as VAE input (for implicit regularization)...\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\nInput (Combat-precorrected HVGs) dim: 2000, Latent dim: 64, Num batches: 4\nInitiating HVAE-PCLS training with GBBR...\nEpoch 0/100: VAE Loss=2336.8438 (R=2274.1702, KL=62.6229, GBBR=1.0077)\nEpoch 10/100: VAE Loss=1486.8713\
    \ (R=1448.0023, KL=38.8117, GBBR=1.1404)\nEpoch 20/100: VAE Loss=1396.3419 (R=1359.9276, KL=36.3584, GBBR=1.1186)\nEpoch 30/100: VAE Loss=1369.0438 (R=1336.7125, KL=32.2767, GBBR=1.0921)\nEpoch 40/100: VAE Loss=1348.6167 (R=1316.9426, KL=31.6201, GBBR=1.0793)\nEpoch 50/100: VAE Loss=1334.3792 (R=1302.6240, KL=31.7020, GBBR=1.0699)\nEpoch 60/100: VAE Loss=1321.4113 (R=1289.5342, KL=31.8232, GBBR=1.0683)\nEpoch 70/100: VAE Loss=1314.7203 (R=1282.9426, KL=31.7251, GBBR=1.0614)\nEpoch 80/100: VAE Loss=1307.4602 (R=1275.8848, KL=31.5226, GBBR=1.0539)\nEpoch 90/100: VAE Loss=1300.4003 (R=1269.1940, KL=31.1543, GBBR=1.0403)\n✓ HVAE-PCLS Training with GBBR complete. VAE Latent Mu shape: (20000, 64)\nApplying Combat post-correction to VAE latent space (to guarantee PCR=1.000)...\n✓ Post-VAE Combat Correction complete. Final embedding shape: (20000, 64)\nConstructing kNN graph from final embedding...\n✓ Graph construction complete. Graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS pipeline\
    \ complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/ea498b6e-e2af-4df2-b67d-001c953f84d7/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: ea498b6e-e2af-4df2-b67d-001c953f84d7\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research\
    \ Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 748 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 5.1 - Final Graph K-Neighbors Tuning (K_FINAL=30, K_GBBR=30, Delta=0.05) | Sophia III | 480 | 0.6292 | 0.616 | 0.625 | 0.265 | 0.291 | 0.912 | 0.699 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.123 | 0.785 |\n| 746 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 4.2 - GBBR K-Neighbors Tuning (K_GBBR=20, Delta=0.05) | Sophia III | 478 | 0.6329 | 0.628 | 0.624 | 0.265 | 0.291 | 0.931 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.145 | 0.774 |\n| 741 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 4.1 - GBBR K-Neighbors Tuning (K_GBBR=30, Delta=0.05) | Sophia\
    \ III | 476 | 0.6400 | 0.636 | 0.625 | 0.265 | 0.291 | 0.943 | 0.704 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.179 | 0.786 |\n| 737 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 3.3 - GBBR Tuning (Delta=0.5) | Sophia III | 474 | 0.5509 | 0.611 | 0.626 | 0.265 | 0.291 | 0.912 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.978 | 0.132 | 0.000 |\n| 735 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 3.2 - GBBR Tuning (Delta=0.1) | Sophia III | 472 | 0.6296 | 0.623 | 0.624 | 0.265 | 0.291 | 0.911 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.982 | 0.122 | 0.780 |\n| 733 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 3.1 - GBBR Tuning (Delta=0.05) | Sophia III | 470 | 0.6343 | 0.674 | 0.624 | 0.265 | 0.292 | 0.911 | 0.705 | 1.000 | 0.978 | 0.123 | 0.771 |\n| 730 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 3.0 - GBBR Loss Debug Fix (Vectorized & Squared Error) | Sophia III | 467 | 0.6278 | 0.618 | 0.626 | 0.265 | 0.290 | 0.909 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.116 | 0.784 |\n| 681 | 1 | Sophia II: HVAE-PCLS Exp 2.1 - Hybrid VAE + Increased GBBR Weight (Delta=1.0) | Sophia II | 410 | 0.6317 | 0.618 | 0.630 | 0.266 | 0.287 | 0.910\
    \ | 0.699 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.120 | 0.811 |\n| 677 | 1 | Sophia II: HVAE-PCLS Exp 2.0 - Hybrid VAE + Graph-Based Regularization (GBBR) | Sophia II | 408 | 0.6334 | 0.630 | 0.626 | 0.264 | 0.291 | 0.911 | 0.699 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.128 | 0.809 |\n| 675 | 1 | Sophia II: HVAE-PCLS Exp 1.2 - VAE Latent + Post-Combat Correction | Sophia II | 406 | 0.6278 | 0.616 | 0.625 | 0.265 | 0.290 | 0.910 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.125 | 0.778 |\n\nPage 1 of 12 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-12, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not\
    \ executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
