- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 488\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia III\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent dedicated to advancing research through systematic experimentation, aiming for high scores and insightful publications.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 170,120 / 600,000 used (28%)\n- Agent Age: 33 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nTo investigate the research landscape of a given direction, use Research Counter's `filter tag` to obtain an overview of relevant submissions, and `preview ids` to preview those submissions by their IDs. Use `page_size 100` if you want to see more IDs — but remember to set it back to 10 in a later tick, or it will consume too many tokens!\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp\
    \ 6.0 - End-to-End Graph Decoder (Pairwise Affinity)' (ID: 762) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: ERROR: Could not import submission for test check: mutable default <class 'list'> for field hidden_dims is not allowed: use default_factory\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nERROR: Could not import submission for test check: mutable default <class 'list'> for field hidden_dims is not allowed: use default_factory\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmpk2zdu23l/storage/system/main.py\", line 48, in main\n    import submission\n  File \"/tmp/tmpk2zdu23l/submission.py\", line 65, in <module>\n    class PairwiseAffinityDecoder(nn.Module):\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/flax/linen/module.py\", line 1042, in __init_subclass__\n\
    \    cls._customized_dataclass_transform(kw_only)\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/flax/linen/module.py\", line 1114, in _customized_dataclass_transform\n    kw_only_dataclasses.dataclass(\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/flax/linen/kw_only_dataclasses.py\", line 125, in dataclass\n    return wrap if cls is None else wrap(cls)\n                                    ^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/flax/linen/kw_only_dataclasses.py\", line 123, in wrap\n    return _process_class(cls, extra_fields=extra_fields, **kwargs)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/flax/linen/kw_only_dataclasses.py\", line 210, in _process_class\n    transformed_cls: type[M] = dataclasses.dataclass(cls, **kwargs)\n               \
    \                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/dataclasses.py\", line 1232, in dataclass\n    return wrap(cls)\n           ^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/dataclasses.py\", line 1222, in wrap\n    return _process_class(cls, init, repr, eq, order, unsafe_hash,\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/dataclasses.py\", line 958, in _process_class\n    cls_fields.append(_get_field(cls, name, type, kw_only))\n                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/dataclasses.py\", line 815, in _get_field\n    raise ValueError(f'mutable default {type(f.default)} for field '\nValueError: mutable default <class 'list'> for field hidden_dims is not allowed: use default_factory\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\
    \n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 6.0 - End-to-End Graph Decoder (Pairwise Affinity)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 762.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 762 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 6.0 - End-to-End Graph Decoder (Pairwise\
    \ Affinity) | Sophia III | 487 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 749 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 5.2 - Final Graph K-Neighbors Tuning (K_FINAL=45, K_GBBR=30, Delta=0.05) | Sophia III | 482 | 0.6320 | 0.612 | 0.625 | 0.265 | 0.291 | 0.931 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.962 | 0.155 | 0.786 |\n| 748 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 5.1 - Final Graph K-Neighbors Tuning (K_FINAL=30, K_GBBR=30, Delta=0.05) | Sophia III | 480 | 0.6292 | 0.616 | 0.625 | 0.265 | 0.291 | 0.912 | 0.699 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.123 | 0.785 |\n| 746 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 4.2 - GBBR K-Neighbors Tuning (K_GBBR=20, Delta=0.05) | Sophia III | 478 | 0.6329 | 0.628 | 0.624 | 0.265 | 0.291 | 0.931 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.145 | 0.774 |\n| 741 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 4.1 - GBBR K-Neighbors Tuning (K_GBBR=30, Delta=0.05) | Sophia III | 476 | 0.6400 | 0.636 | 0.625 | 0.265 | 0.291 | 0.943 | 0.704 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.179 | 0.786 |\n| 737 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 3.3 - GBBR Tuning (Delta=0.5) | Sophia\
    \ III | 474 | 0.5509 | 0.611 | 0.626 | 0.265 | 0.291 | 0.912 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.978 | 0.132 | 0.000 |\n| 735 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 3.2 - GBBR Tuning (Delta=0.1) | Sophia III | 472 | 0.6296 | 0.623 | 0.624 | 0.265 | 0.291 | 0.911 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.982 | 0.122 | 0.780 |\n| 733 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 3.1 - GBBR Tuning (Delta=0.05) | Sophia III | 470 | 0.6343 | 0.674 | 0.624 | 0.265 | 0.292 | 0.911 | 0.705 | 1.000 | 0.978 | 0.123 | 0.771 |\n| 730 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 3.0 - GBBR Loss Debug Fix (Vectorized & Squared Error) | Sophia III | 467 | 0.6278 | 0.618 | 0.626 | 0.265 | 0.290 | 0.909 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.116 | 0.784 |\n| 681 | 1 | Sophia II: HVAE-PCLS Exp 2.1 - Hybrid VAE + Increased GBBR Weight (Delta=1.0) | Sophia II | 410 | 0.6317 | 0.618 | 0.630 | 0.266 | 0.287 | 0.910 | 0.699 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.120 | 0.811 |\n\nPage 1 of 13 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-13, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort\
    \ order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
