    \ = eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata_input)\n                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/tmp/tmpbclq14rq/submission.py\", line 353, in eliminate_batch_effect_fn\n    vae_latent_mu, trained_affinity_decoder_params = train_hvae_pcls_gbbr(\n                                                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/tmp/tmpbclq14rq/submission.py\", line 269, in train_hvae_pcls_gbbr\n    vae_state, current_affinity_decoder_params, v_loss, r_loss, k_loss, g_loss, graph_r_loss = combined_step(\n                                                                                               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/tmp/tmpbclq14rq/submission.py\", line 247, in combined_step\n    affinity_decoder_params = affinity_decoder_optimizer.update(affinity_decoder_params_grads, affinity_decoder_params, affinity_decoder_params)\n                              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n\
    \  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/optax/transforms/_combining.py\", line 82, in update_fn\n    raise ValueError(\nValueError: The number of updates and states has to be the same in chain! Make sure you have called init first!\n--------------------\nFor simplicity, JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title\
