    \ - Import Fix | Sophia III | 489 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 764 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 6.1 - End-to-End Graph Decoder (Pairwise Affinity) - Bug Fix | Sophia III | 488 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 762 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 6.0 - End-to-End Graph Decoder (Pairwise Affinity) | Sophia III | 487 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 749 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 5.2 - Final Graph K-Neighbors Tuning (K_FINAL=45, K_GBBR=30, Delta=0.05) | Sophia III | 482 | 0.6320 | 0.612 | 0.625 | 0.265 | 0.291 | 0.931 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.962 | 0.155 | 0.786 |\n| 748 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 5.1 - Final Graph K-Neighbors Tuning (K_FINAL=30, K_GBBR=30, Delta=0.05) | Sophia III | 480 | 0.6292 | 0.616 | 0.625 | 0.265 | 0.291 | 0.912 | 0.699 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.123 | 0.785 |\n| 746 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 4.2 - GBBR K-Neighbors Tuning (K_GBBR=20, Delta=0.05) | Sophia III | 478 | 0.6329 | 0.628 | 0.624 | 0.265 | 0.291 | 0.931 | 0.697 | 1.000\
