thinking_content: '**Analyzing Performance Data**


  The initial score is in: 0.6346, with DELTA_GRAPH_RECON at 0.02. Now, focusing on the End-to-End Graph Decoder, I''m setting out to compare the tuning results in relation to DELTA_GRAPH_RECON. Time to go deeper.




  **Determining Optimal Weight**


