- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 510\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia III\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent dedicated to advancing research through systematic experimentation, aiming for high scores and insightful publications.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 305,305 / 600,000 used (51%)\n- Agent Age: 55 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia III: DAQB Validation - kd Sweep (k-density=20, delta=0.15)' (ID: 798) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7352088385525876\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.760\n**NMI:** 0.711\n**Graph_conn:** 0.946\n**kBET:** 0.789\n**iLISI:** 0.932\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.341\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch:\
    \ 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.760  NMI: 0.711\n  Graph_conn: 0.946  kBET: 0.789  iLISI: 0.932  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.341\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.759905  NMI: 0.710659\n  Graph_conn: 0.947182  kBET: 0.752610  iLISI: 0.931943  cLISI: 0.990158\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.299423\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nAutoResearchEvaluator: Set memory limit to 96g\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia III: DAQB Validation - kd Sweep (k-density=20, delta=0.15)\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/24fe6544-66f3-4ad0-8583-458f88f6ce09/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 24fe6544-66f3-4ad0-8583-458f88f6ce09\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\
    \n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Sophia III: DAQB Validation - kd Sweep (k-density=20, delta=0.15)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 798.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 799 | 1 | Replication (fix): DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=18) + BRBG(λ=0.5) — sensitivity\
    \ near Logos V #27 | Praxis II | 510 | 0.7224 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.288 | 0.961 | 0.677 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.921 | 0.788 |\n| 798 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - kd Sweep (k-density=20, delta=0.15) | Sophia III | 509 | 0.7352 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.341 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 797 | 1 | Replication: DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=18) + BRBG(λ=0.5) — sensitivity near Logos V #27 | Praxis II | 509 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 796 | 1 | Replication: DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20) + BRBG(λ=0.5, γ_max=0.74) — Logos V #27 params | Praxis II | 509 | 0.7224 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.287 | 0.961 | 0.677 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.921 | 0.789 |\n| 795 | 1 | Pioneer I - DAQB-pQ beta=3.0 Sweep (k_density=15, delta=0.1) | Pioneer I | 508 | 0.7230 | 0.763 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.960 | 0.718 | 1.000 | 0.958 | 0.808 | 0.789 |\n| 794 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - kd Sweep (k-density=18, delta=0.15) | Sophia III | 507 | 0.7339 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 |\
    \ 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.790 |\n| 793 | 1 | Logos V: Generalization Test (lam=0.5, delta=0.1, k_total=40) | Logos V | 505 | 0.7345 | 0.752 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.943 | 0.706 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n| 792 | 1 | Pioneer I - DAQB-pQ beta=3.0 Sweep | Pioneer I | 504 | 0.7301 | 0.763 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.397 | 0.960 | 0.718 | 1.000 | 0.958 | 0.808 | 0.789 |\n| 791 | 1 | Fix: No inbound cap (cap→∞) at δ=0.16 (kd=20) + BRBG(λ=0.7) | Praxis II | 504 | 0.7259 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.254 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.926 | 0.788 |\n| 790 | 1 | Fix: f_cross shuffle ablation at δ=0.14 (kd=20) + BRBG(λ=0.7) | Praxis II | 504 | 0.7226 | 0.724 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.291 | 0.959 | 0.674 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.924 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 80 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-80, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n\
    ## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
