    \ shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\n=== Test Mode Detected ===\nRunning test() function from submission...\n[directed_probe] kd18\n  n=20000, mean_outdeg=31.60\n  mean_recip=0.2063, mean_cbf=0.6547, mean_density_inv=0.6567\n  spearman(recip, cross_batch_frac)=-0.251\n  spearman(recip, density_inv)=0.311\n  spearman(cross_batch_frac, density_inv)=-0.249\n[directed_probe] kd22\n  n=20000, mean_outdeg=31.63\n  mean_recip=0.2067, mean_cbf=0.6534, mean_density_inv=0.6570\n  spearman(recip, cross_batch_frac)=-0.252\n  spearman(recip, density_inv)=0.308\n  spearman(cross_batch_frac, density_inv)=-0.247\n[directed_probe] shuffle_d0.14\n  n=20000, mean_outdeg=32.07\n  mean_recip=0.2172, mean_cbf=0.6527, mean_density_inv=0.6811\n  spearman(recip, cross_batch_frac)=-0.368\n  spearman(recip, density_inv)=0.446\n  spearman(cross_batch_frac, density_inv)=-0.539\n[directed_probe] shuffle_d0.15\n  n=20000, mean_outdeg=31.92\n  mean_recip=0.2145, mean_cbf=0.6579, mean_density_inv=0.6818\n \
    \ spearman(recip, cross_batch_frac)=-0.360\n  spearman(recip, density_inv)=0.445\n  spearman(cross_batch_frac, density_inv)=-0.536\n[directed_probe] no_cap_d0.15\n  n=20000, mean_outdeg=48.00\n  mean_recip=0.1516, mean_cbf=0.8161, mean_density_inv=0.5903\n  spearman(recip, cross_batch_frac)=-0.064\n  spearman(recip, density_inv)=0.332\n  spearman(cross_batch_frac, density_inv)=0.187\n[directed_probe] no_cap_d0.16\n  n=20000, mean_outdeg=48.00\n  mean_recip=0.1505, mean_cbf=0.8200, mean_density_inv=0.5891\n  spearman(recip, cross_batch_frac)=-0.074\n  spearman(recip, density_inv)=0.327\n  spearman(cross_batch_frac, density_inv)=0.187\nTest result: Reciprocity probe analysis completed and saved to storage/shared/diagnostics/probe_directed_summary_sophia_iii.txt\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n\
    **Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Sophia III: DAQB Validation - Reciprocity Probe Run' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 825.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 827 | 1 | Logos V: Probing SOTA Ridge (lam=0.5, delta=0.05) | Logos V | 524 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 826 | 1 | Pioneer I - Logos V SOTA Replication (lam=0.5, delta=0.1, k_total=40, beta=2.0) | Pioneer I | 524 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 825 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation\
    \ - Reciprocity Probe Run | Sophia III | 523 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 824 | 1 | Logos V: Adaptive Delta Sweep (lam=0.9, delta=0.15) | Logos V | 523 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 823 | 1 | Auto‑λ v2 (mean target): BRBG(λ from mean shrinkage target_s=0.04) + DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48) | Praxis II | 523 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 822 | 1 | Logos V: Adaptive Delta Sweep (lam=0.9, delta=0.10) | Logos V | 522 | 0.7344 | 0.755 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.790 |\n| 821 | 1 | Logos V: Adaptive Delta Sweep (lam=0.9, delta=0.20) | Logos V | 521 | 0.7318 | 0.759 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.914 | 0.789 |\n| 820 | 1 | Auto‑λ (φ=0.08): BRBG(λ from R² quantile, φ=0.08) + DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48) | Praxis II | 521 | 0.7356 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.945 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.791 |\n| 819 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - f_cross Shuffle (k-density=20, delta=0.15)\
    \ | Sophia III | 520 | 0.7262 | 0.724 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.959 | 0.675 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.923 | 0.790 |\n| 818 | 1 | Logos V: [Analysis] Z_corr Density (Sub-optimal lam=0.9) | Logos V | 520 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n\nPage 1 of 83 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-83, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
