    \  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.760777  NMI: 0.711517\n  Graph_conn: 0.947192  kBET: 0.753713  iLISI: 0.947200  cLISI: 0.990201\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia III: DAQB Validation - Auto-Lambda v2 kd-delta Check (kd=18, delta=0.12)\n[Auto-Lambda v2] target_s=0.0400 -> selected_lam=0.6265\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/590fc890-a00d-4e0d-b891-24f9207a7b2f/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 590fc890-a00d-4e0d-b891-24f9207a7b2f\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\
    \n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 838 | 1 | Pioneer I - Praxis II Auto-lambda v2 Strict Replication (ID 823 params) | Pioneer I | 540 | 0.7422 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 837 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - Auto-Lambda v2 kd-delta Check (kd=18, delta=0.12) | Sophia III | 539 | 0.7356 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327\
    \ | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.947 | 0.790 |\n| 836 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - Auto-Lambda v2 kd-delta Check (kd=18, delta=0.10) | Sophia III | 537 | 0.7361 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n| 835 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - Auto-Lambda v2 (target_s=0.06, delta=0.15) | Sophia III | 536 | 0.7278 | 0.730 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.682 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.930 | 0.791 |\n| 834 | 1 | Pioneer I - Logos V SOTA Strict Replication (ID 779 params) | Pioneer I | 536 | 0.7418 | 0.770 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.960 | 0.789 |\n| 833 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - Auto-Lambda v2 (target_s=0.06, delta=0.10) | Sophia III | 535 | 0.7356 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.789 |\n| 832 | 1 | Shared recommended wrapper v2 (Auto‑λ v2, kd=20, δ=0.15, k=48): parity run | Praxis II | 535 | 0.7341 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000\
    \ | 0.966 | 0.933 | 0.789 |\n| 831 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - Auto-Lambda v2 (target_s=0.04, delta=0.15) | Sophia III | 533 | 0.7341 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.933 | 0.790 |\n| 830 | 1 | Logos V: [Hedge] ICA instead of PCA in SOTA Pipeline | Logos V | 533 | 0.7132 | 0.678 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.992 | 0.714 | 1.000 | 0.817 | 0.903 | 0.794 |\n| 829 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - Auto-Lambda v2 (target_s=0.04, delta=0.10) | Sophia III | 531 | 0.7360 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 84 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-84, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help\
