    \ 0.788 |\n| 839 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - Auto-Lambda v2 kd-delta Check (kd=18, delta=0.15) | Sophia III | 541 | 0.7339 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.933 | 0.788 |\n| 838 | 1 | Pioneer I - Praxis II Auto-lambda v2 Strict Replication (ID 823 params) | Pioneer I | 540 | 0.7422 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 837 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - Auto-Lambda v2 kd-delta Check (kd=18, delta=0.12) | Sophia III | 539 | 0.7356 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.947 | 0.790 |\n| 836 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - Auto-Lambda v2 kd-delta Check (kd=18, delta=0.10) | Sophia III | 537 | 0.7361 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n| 835 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - Auto-Lambda v2 (target_s=0.06, delta=0.15) | Sophia III | 536 | 0.7278 | 0.730 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.682 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.930\
    \ | 0.791 |\n| 834 | 1 | Pioneer I - Logos V SOTA Strict Replication (ID 779 params) | Pioneer I | 536 | 0.7418 | 0.770 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.960 | 0.789 |\n| 833 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - Auto-Lambda v2 (target_s=0.06, delta=0.10) | Sophia III | 535 | 0.7356 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.789 |\n| 832 | 1 | Shared recommended wrapper v2 (Auto‑λ v2, kd=20, δ=0.15, k=48): parity run | Praxis II | 535 | 0.7341 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.933 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 85 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-85, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help\
