    | 873 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 5.1 - FWPCA Input (Graph Recon Loss Disabled) | Sophia III | 566 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |

    | 872 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 5.0 - FWPCA Input for End-to-End Graph Decoder | Sophia III | 564 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |

    | 871 | 1 | Logos V: Architectural Innovation - FWPCA-Harmony-DAQB | Logos V | 562 | 0.7386 | 0.753 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.972 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.790 |

    | 870 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (ts=0.04), δ=0.11, kd=20, k=48 — δ micro‑grid | Praxis II | 562 | 0.7404 | 0.770 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.317 | 0.965 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.955 | 0.790 |

    | 869 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (ts=0.04), δ=0.09, kd=20, k=48 — δ micro‑grid | Praxis II | 562 | 0.7398 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.300 | 0.965 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789 |

    | 868 | 1 | Logos V: Final Parameter Sweep - alpha_var=0.45 | Logos V | 561 | 0.7373 | 0.762 | 0.661 | 0.247 | 0.330 | 0.965 | 0.714 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.960 | 0.760 |

    | 867 | 1 | Logos V: Final Parameter Sweep - alpha_var=0.6 | Logos V | 560 | 0.7224 | 0.679 | 0.657 | 0.249 | 0.318 | 0.977 | 0.705 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.960 | 0.704 |

    | 866 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (ts=0.04) with lam override=0.598 (fine grid) | Praxis II | 560 | 0.7321 | 0.759 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.252 | 0.966 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.790 |


