    \ 3\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 5.2 - FWPCA Input Ablation (GR Disabled)' (ID: 878) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6309007278506462\n**ASW_batch:** 0.625\n**ASW_label:** 0.270\n**ARI:** 0.611\n**NMI:** 0.690\n**Graph_conn:** 0.946\n**kBET:** 0.784\n**iLISI:** 0.172\n**cLISI:** 0.955\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.257\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.625  ASW_label: 0.270  ARI: 0.611  NMI: 0.690\n  Graph_conn: 0.946  kBET: 0.784  iLISI: 0.172  cLISI: 0.955\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.257\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.815016  ASW_label: 0.567839  ARI: 0.610683  NMI: 0.690036\n  Graph_conn: 0.946736  kBET: 0.747863  iLISI: 0.171810  cLISI: 0.986751\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.228249\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches:\
    \ 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 5.2 - FWPCA Input Ablation (GR Disabled)\nApplying ComBat pre-correction as VAE input (for implicit regularization)...\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\nInput (Combat-precorrected HVGs, no FWPCA) dim: 2000, Latent dim: 64, Graph Dec Hidden: [128, 64]\nInitiating HVAE-PCLS training with GBBR and End-to-End Graph Decoder...\nEpoch 0/100: VAE Loss=2306.7888 (R=2244.0671, KL=62.6712, GBBR=1.0112, GR=0.0000)\nEpoch 10/100: VAE Loss=1417.2117 (R=1383.8386, KL=33.3188, GBBR=1.0895, GR=0.0000)\nEpoch 20/100: VAE Loss=1375.7434 (R=1345.5499, KL=30.1397, GBBR=1.0842, GR=0.0000)\nEpoch 30/100: VAE Loss=1358.0227 (R=1327.6289, KL=30.3398, GBBR=1.0753, GR=0.0000)\nEpoch 40/100: VAE Loss=1341.4049 (R=1309.9873, KL=31.3640, GBBR=1.0746, GR=0.0000)\nEpoch 50/100: VAE Loss=1332.5741 (R=1301.0591, KL=31.4613, GBBR=1.0685, GR=0.0000)\nEpoch 60/100: VAE Loss=1324.4807 (R=1292.8655,\
    \ KL=31.5620, GBBR=1.0593, GR=0.0000)\nEpoch 70/100: VAE Loss=1320.1484 (R=1288.3738, KL=31.7221, GBBR=1.0526, GR=0.0000)\nEpoch 80/100: VAE Loss=1314.3463 (R=1282.5776, KL=31.7164, GBBR=1.0454, GR=0.0000)\nEpoch 90/100: VAE Loss=1309.2428 (R=1277.4290, KL=31.7621, GBBR=1.0387, GR=0.0000)\n✓ HVAE-PCLS Training complete. VAE Latent Mu shape: (20000, 64)\nApplying Combat post-correction to VAE latent space (to guarantee PCR=1.000)...\n✓ Post-VAE Combat Correction complete. Final embedding shape: (20000, 64)\nConstructing kNN graph from final embedding...\n✓ Final Graph construction complete. Graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia III: SCGA-ABI pipeline with FWPCA input ablation complete (GR disabled).\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/f3216448-875e-4ea1-a16c-41249a6a7476/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: f3216448-875e-4ea1-a16c-41249a6a7476\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343:\
    \ RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle\
    \ | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 878 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 5.2 - FWPCA Input Ablation (GR Disabled) | Sophia III | 568 | 0.6309 | 0.611 | 0.625 | 0.270 | 0.257 | 0.946 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.955 | 0.172 | 0.784 |\n| 877 | 1 | Logos V: Harmony Sweep for Paper - theta=1.0 | Logos V | 568 | 0.7421 | 0.753 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.363 | 0.972 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 876 | 1 | Logos V: Harmony Sweep for Paper - theta=0.5 | Logos V | 568 | 0.7305 | 0.730 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.294 | 0.961 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 875 | 1 | Generalization (2): PCA50 + BRBG + vanilla kNN (k=48) on Zcorr (no GraphFWPCA) | Praxis II | 567 | 0.6149 | 0.469 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.355 | 0.942 | 0.674 | 1.000 | 0.989 | 0.023 | 0.789 |\n| 874 | 1 | Generalization (1): GraphFWPCA + BRBG + vanilla kNN (k=48) on Zcorr | Praxis II | 567 | 0.6127 | 0.497 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.296 | 0.937 | 0.685 | 1.000\
    \ | 0.992 | 0.024 | 0.788 |\n| 873 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 5.1 - FWPCA Input (Graph Recon Loss Disabled) | Sophia III | 566 | 0.6377 | 0.623 | 0.584 | 0.289 | 0.295 | 0.953 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.983 | 0.131 | 0.820 |\n| 872 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 5.0 - FWPCA Input for End-to-End Graph Decoder | Sophia III | 564 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 871 | 1 | Logos V: Architectural Innovation - FWPCA-Harmony-DAQB | Logos V | 562 | 0.7386 | 0.753 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.972 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 870 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (ts=0.04), δ=0.11, kd=20, k=48 — δ micro‑grid | Praxis II | 562 | 0.7404 | 0.770 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.317 | 0.965 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.955 | 0.790 |\n| 869 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (ts=0.04), δ=0.09, kd=20, k=48 — δ micro‑grid | Praxis II | 562 | 0.7398 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.300 | 0.965 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 88 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate\
    \ pages 1-88, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
