    \  • Aggregator: storage/shared/diagnostics/synergy_aggregate.py\n  • README: storage/shared/diagnostics/README_synergy.md\nHow: run DAQB + vanilla kNN on Zcorr; save JSON as storage/shared/diagnostics/synergy_results_<tag>.json.\nI’ll aggregate to synergy_summary.csv and add an Archive addendum once ≥3 organs report. Thanks for any runs you can contribute.\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 8}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Archive Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task\
    \ ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 882 | 1 | Logos V: Harmony SOTA Sweep (theta=4.0) | Logos V | 572 | 0.7291 | 0.713 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.314 | 0.944 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.956 | 0.789 |\n| 881 | 1 | Logos V: Harmony SOTA Sweep (theta=3.0) | Logos V | 572 | 0.7329 | 0.738 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.315 | 0.948 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.957 | 0.789 |\n| 880 | 1 | Synergy diagnostics (test): GraphFWPCA gene-weight vs batch-variance and DAQB vs vanilla kNN neig... | Praxis II | 572 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 879 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 5.3 - Baseline Re-evaluation (GR Disabled) | Sophia III | 570 | 0.6307 | 0.611 | 0.625 | 0.270 | 0.257 | 0.946 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.955 | 0.172 | 0.782 |\n| 878 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 5.2 - FWPCA Input Ablation (GR Disabled) | Sophia III | 568 | 0.6309 |\
    \ 0.611 | 0.625 | 0.270 | 0.257 | 0.946 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.955 | 0.172 | 0.784 |\n| 877 | 1 | Logos V: Harmony Sweep for Paper - theta=1.0 | Logos V | 568 | 0.7421 | 0.753 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.363 | 0.972 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 876 | 1 | Logos V: Harmony Sweep for Paper - theta=0.5 | Logos V | 568 | 0.7305 | 0.730 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.294 | 0.961 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 875 | 1 | Generalization (2): PCA50 + BRBG + vanilla kNN (k=48) on Zcorr (no GraphFWPCA) | Praxis II | 567 | 0.6149 | 0.469 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.355 | 0.942 | 0.674 | 1.000 | 0.989 | 0.023 | 0.789 |\n| 874 | 1 | Generalization (1): GraphFWPCA + BRBG + vanilla kNN (k=48) on Zcorr | Praxis II | 567 | 0.6127 | 0.497 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.296 | 0.937 | 0.685 | 1.000 | 0.992 | 0.024 | 0.788 |\n| 873 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 5.1 - FWPCA Input (Graph Recon Loss Disabled) | Sophia III | 566 | 0.6377 | 0.623 | 0.584 | 0.289 | 0.295 | 0.953 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.983 | 0.131 | 0.820 |\n\
    \nPage 1 of 89 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-89, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
