tick: 581
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 581\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia III\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent dedicated to advancing research through systematic experimentation, aiming for high scores and insightful publications.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 315,833 / 600,000 used (53%)\n- Agent Age: 126 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 880**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Synergy diagnostics (test): GraphFWPCA gene-weight vs batch-variance and DAQB vs vanilla kNN neighbor persistence\n**ID:** 880\n**Tags:** graph-fwpca, diagnostics, daqb, knn, residualization, batch-variance\n**Abstract:** Label-free analysis (test mode) to probe why GraphFWPCA synergizes with DAQB. We compute: (1) Spearman correlation between GraphFWPCA gene weights and between-batch variance ratios; (2) per-cell neighbor persistence and cross-batch fraction deltas between DAQB and\
    \ vanilla kNN graphs on Zcorr. Outputs are printed as JSON summaries.\n**Score:** n.a.\n**Evaluation Details:** Test mode - no scoring\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Test mode - no scoring\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys, json\nimport numpy as np\nimport anndata as ad\nimport scanpy as sc\nfrom scipy import sparse as sp\nfrom sklearn.neighbors import NearestNeighbors\nfrom scipy.stats import spearmanr\n\nsys.path.append('storage/praxis')\nfrom bbsg_density_adaptive import build_density_adaptive_bbsg\n\ndef _to_dense(X):\n    return X.A if sp.isspmatrix(X) else X\n\ndef _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata: ad.AnnData, target_sum=1e4):\n    if 'counts' in adata.layers:\n        adata.X = adata.layers['counts'].copy()\n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata, target_sum=target_sum, inplace=True)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata)\n\ndef _pca_graph_fwpca(X, hv_mask, alpha_g=0.5, n_comps=50, random_state=0):\n    Xh = X[:, hv_mask] if hv_mask is not None else X\n    Xd = _to_dense(Xh).astype(np.float32,\
    \ copy=False)\n    var_g = Xd.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n    w = np.power(var_g, -0.5 * float(alpha_g)).astype(np.float32)\n    Xw = Xd * w\n    ad_tmp = ad.AnnData(Xw)\n    sc.pp.pca(ad_tmp, n_comps=n_comps, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=random_state)\n    return ad_tmp.obsm['X_pca'], w, var_g\n\ndef _one_hot_batches(batches):\n    cats = np.unique(batches)\n    B = np.zeros((batches.shape[0], cats.size), dtype=float)\n    for j, c in enumerate(cats):\n        B[:, j] = (batches == c).astype(float)\n    return B\n\ndef _ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Z, l2=1e-3):\n    BTB = B.T @ B + l2 * np.eye(B.shape[1], dtype=float)\n    W = np.linalg.solve(BTB, B.T @ Z)\n    return B @ W\n\ndef _choose_lambda_from_r2_mean(Z, batches, gamma_max=0.74, s_target=0.04, l2=1e-3, lam_min=0.2, lam_max=1.0, iters=32, tol=1e-4):\n    B = _one_hot_batches(batches)\n    Zhat = _ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Z, l2=l2)\n    var_total = Z.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n    var_pred = np.maximum(Zhat.var(axis=0, ddof=1),\
    \ 0.0)\n    R2 = np.clip(var_pred / var_total, 0.0, 1.0)\n    lo, hi = lam_min, lam_max\n    for _ in range(iters):\n        mid = 0.5 * (lo + hi)\n        gamma = np.minimum(gamma_max, mid * R2)\n        s_bar = float(gamma.mean() / gamma_max)\n        if abs(s_bar - s_target) <= tol:\n            return mid\n        if s_bar < s_target:\n            lo = mid\n        else:\n            hi = mid\n    return 0.5 * (lo + hi)\n\ndef _neighbor_persistence(A_daqb, A_knn, batches):\n    if not sp.isspmatrix_csr(A_daqb): A_daqb = A_daqb.tocsr()\n    if not sp.isspmatrix_csr(A_knn): A_knn = A_knn.tocsr()\n    n = A_daqb.shape[0]\n    batches = np.asarray(batches)\n    jacc = np.zeros(n, dtype=np.float32)\n    cbf_d = np.zeros(n, dtype=np.float32)\n    cbf_k = np.zeros(n, dtype=np.float32)\n    for i in range(n):\n        ai = A_daqb.indices[A_daqb.indptr[i]:A_daqb.indptr[i+1]]\n        bi = A_knn.indices[A_knn.indptr[i]:A_knn.indptr[i+1]]\n        if ai.size == 0 or bi.size == 0:\n        \
    \    jacc[i] = 0.0\n        else:\n            inter = np.intersect1d(ai, bi, assume_unique=False).size\n            union = np.union1d(ai, bi).size\n            jacc[i] = inter / union if union > 0 else 0.0\n        cbf_d[i] = 0.0 if ai.size == 0 else np.mean(batches[ai] != batches[i])\n        cbf_k[i] = 0.0 if bi.size == 0 else np.mean(batches[bi] != batches[i])\n    delta_cbf = cbf_d - cbf_k\n    return {\n        'jaccard_median': float(np.median(jacc)),\n        'jaccard_mean': float(np.mean(jacc)),\n        'cbf_daqb_median': float(np.median(cbf_d)),\n        'cbf_knn_median': float(np.median(cbf_k)),\n        'delta_cbf_median': float(np.median(delta_cbf)),\n        'delta_cbf_mean': float(np.mean(delta_cbf)),\n    }\n\ndef test(adata: ad.AnnData):\n    # Config (MPB-GraphFWPCA path)\n    n_pcs_graph = 50\n    alpha_g = 0.5\n    gamma_max = 0.74\n    s_target = 0.04\n    k_total = 48\n    metric = 'cosine'\n    kdensity = 20\n    delta = 0.10\n\n    # Normalize + HVGs\n    _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata,\
    \ 1e4)\n    sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata, flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch', n_top_genes=2000, inplace=True)\n    hv = adata.var['highly_variable'].to_numpy()\n    batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n\n    # GraphFWPCA Z + weights, and batch variance ratios\n    Zg, w_g, var_g = _pca_graph_fwpca(adata.X, hv_mask=hv, alpha_g=alpha_g, n_comps=n_pcs_graph, random_state=0)\n    Xh = _to_dense(adata.X[:, hv]).astype(np.float32, copy=False)\n    cats, inv = np.unique(batches, return_inverse=True)\n    nb = cats.size\n    mu = Xh.mean(axis=0)\n    mu_b = np.stack([Xh[inv == j].mean(axis=0) if np.any(inv == j) else np.zeros_like(mu) for j in range(nb)], axis=0)\n    w_counts = np.bincount(inv, minlength=nb).astype(np.float32); w_counts /= max(1, w_counts.sum())\n    mu_w = (w_counts[:, None] * mu_b).sum(axis=0)\n    var_between = (w_counts[:, None] * (mu_b - mu_w)**2).sum(axis=0) + 1e-8\n    between_ratio = var_between / (var_g + 1e-8)\n    rho, p = spearmanr(w_g,\
    \ between_ratio)\n\n    # Residualize (BRBG) and choose lambda\n    lam = _choose_lambda_from_r2_mean(Zg, batches, gamma_max=gamma_max, s_target=s_target, l2=1e-3)\n    B = _one_hot_batches(batches)\n    Zhat = _ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Zg, l2=1e-3)\n    var_total = Zg.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n    var_pred = np.maximum(Zhat.var(axis=0, ddof=1), 0.0)\n    R2 = np.clip(var_pred / var_total, 0.0, 1.0)\n    gamma = np.minimum(gamma_max, lam * R2)\n    Zcorr = Zg - (Zhat * gamma)\n\n    # Density proxy: distance to kdensity-th NN (all-batch)\n    nn = NearestNeighbors(n_neighbors=kdensity + 1, metric=metric, algorithm='brute')\n    nn.fit(Zcorr)\n    d_all, idx_all = nn.kneighbors(Zcorr, return_distance=True)\n    d_k = d_all[:, -1]\n\n    # Build DAQB graph on Zcorr\n    Cg, Dg = build_density_adaptive_bbsg(Zcorr.astype(np.float32), batches=batches,\n                                         k_total=k_total, metric=metric,\n                                         delta=delta, k_density=kdensity,\
    \ rng_seed=0)\n    # Build vanilla kNN on Zcorr\n    adata.obsm['X_graph'] = Zcorr.astype(np.float32)\n    sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_graph', n_neighbors=k_total, metric=metric)\n    C_knn = adata.obsp['connectivities'].tocsr().astype(np.float32)\n\n    # Summaries\n    neighbor_summary = _neighbor_persistence(Cg, C_knn, batches=batches)\n    out = {\n        'alpha_g': alpha_g,\n        'lambda_selected': float(lam),\n        'spearman_w_vs_between_ratio': {'rho': float(rho), 'p': float(p)},\n        'neighbor_persistence': neighbor_summary,\n        'density_proxy_stats': {'dk_median': float(np.median(d_k)), 'dk_mean': float(np.mean(d_k))},\n    }\n    print(json.dumps(out, indent=2))\n    return \"synergy_diagnostics_completed\"\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\n=== Test Mode Detected ===\nRunning test() function\
    \ from submission...\n{\n  \"alpha_g\": 0.5,\n  \"lambda_selected\": 0.6,\n  \"spearman_w_vs_between_ratio\": {\n    \"rho\": -0.579344581651882,\n    \"p\": 1.1727379766296165e-179\n  },\n  \"neighbor_persistence\": {\n    \"jaccard_median\": 0.14173229038715363,\n    \"jaccard_mean\": 0.1628803163766861,\n    \"cbf_daqb_median\": 0.7692307829856873,\n    \"cbf_knn_median\": 0.016949152573943138,\n    \"delta_cbf_median\": 0.7115384340286255,\n    \"delta_cbf_mean\": 0.6776261329650879\n  },\n  \"density_proxy_stats\": {\n    \"dk_median\": 0.12411335090099901,\n    \"dk_mean\": 0.1470218010364551\n  }\n}\nTest result: synergy_diagnostics_completed\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 880` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 880 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n\
    | 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 887 | 1 | Logos V: SOTA Attempt - FWPCA-Harmony-kNN | Logos V | 581 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 886 | 1 | Aletheia I - Scanpy Combat Baseline | Aletheia I | 579 | 0.5941 | 0.591 | 0.676 | 0.223 | 0.294 | 0.878 | 0.692 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.057 | 0.543 |\n| 885 | 1 | Aletheia I - Mean Center PCA Baseline | Aletheia I | 578 | 0.5716 | 0.457 | 0.640 | 0.220 | 0.303 | 0.876 | 0.665 | 1.000 | 0.989 | 0.012 | 0.553 |\n| 884 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 5.4 - Verified Baseline | Sophia III | 577 | 0.6402 | 0.636 | 0.625 | 0.265 | 0.291 | 0.943 | 0.704\
    \ | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.179 | 0.788 |\n| 883 | 1 | Logos V: Harmony Negative Result Generalization (Vanilla kNN) | Logos V | 577 | 0.6824 | 0.788 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.956 | 0.746 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.324 | 0.789 |\n| 882 | 1 | Logos V: Harmony SOTA Sweep (theta=4.0) | Logos V | 572 | 0.7291 | 0.713 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.314 | 0.944 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.956 | 0.789 |\n| 881 | 1 | Logos V: Harmony SOTA Sweep (theta=3.0) | Logos V | 572 | 0.7329 | 0.738 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.315 | 0.948 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.957 | 0.789 |\n| 880 | 1 | Synergy diagnostics (test): GraphFWPCA gene-weight vs batch-variance and DAQB vs vanilla kNN neig... | Praxis II | 572 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 879 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 5.3 - Baseline Re-evaluation (GR Disabled) | Sophia III | 570 | 0.6307 | 0.611 | 0.625 | 0.270 | 0.257 | 0.946 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.955 | 0.172 | 0.782 |\n| 878 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 5.2 - FWPCA Input Ablation (GR Disabled) | Sophia III | 568\
    \ | 0.6309 | 0.611 | 0.625 | 0.270 | 0.257 | 0.946 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.955 | 0.172 | 0.784 |\n\nPage 1 of 89 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-89, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
