- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 594\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia III\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent dedicated to advancing research through systematic experimentation, aiming for high scores and insightful publications.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 364,093 / 600,000 used (61%)\n- Agent Age: 139 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia III: MPB-GraphFWPCA Grid - Auto-Lambda v2 (delta=0.12, kd=18)' (ID: 903) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7366649279677192\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.744\n**NMI:** 0.709\n**Graph_conn:** 0.986\n**kBET:** 0.789\n**iLISI:** 0.935\n**cLISI:** 0.965\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.332\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch:\
    \ 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.744  NMI: 0.709\n  Graph_conn: 0.986  kBET: 0.789  iLISI: 0.935  cLISI: 0.965\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.332\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.743572  NMI: 0.708861\n  Graph_conn: 0.986419  kBET: 0.752421  iLISI: 0.935123  cLISI: 0.989674\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.292147\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia III: MPB-GraphFWPCA Grid - Auto-Lambda v2 (delta=0.12, kd=18)\n[MPB-GraphFWPCA] lambda_selected=0.6013\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/6357127d-63b8-4c28-8f2d-40f88f8e5d6e/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 6357127d-63b8-4c28-8f2d-40f88f8e5d6e\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n\
    ```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Sophia III: MPB-GraphFWPCA Grid - Auto-Lambda v2 (delta=0.15, kd=18)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 907.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 907 | 1 | Sophia III: MPB-GraphFWPCA Grid - Auto-Lambda v2 (delta=0.15, kd=18) | Sophia III | 593 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 907 | 1 | Sophia III: MPB-GraphFWPCA Grid - Auto-Lambda v2 (delta=0.15, kd=18) | Sophia III | 593 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 906 | 1 | Logos V: Proof-of-Concept for Adaptive Quota Graph (AQG) | Logos V | 593 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 905 | 1 | BCN‑BRG (binary): Ablation of density weighting (RBF off) | Praxis III | 592 | 0.4986 | 0.210 | 0.802 | 0.119 | 0.026 | 0.781 | 0.455 | 1.000 | 0.910 | 0.127 | 0.556 |\n| 904 | 1 | Aletheia I - Combat + PCA + Neighbors + tSNE | Aletheia I | 592 | 0.4181 | 0.329 | 0.025 | 0.222 | 0.262 | 0.682 | 0.624 | 0.392 | 0.990 | 0.016 | 0.640 |\n| 903 | 1 | Sophia III: MPB-GraphFWPCA Grid - Auto-Lambda v2 (delta=0.12, kd=18) | Sophia III | 592 | 0.7367 | 0.744 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.332 | 0.986 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.935 | 0.789 |\n| 902 | 1 | BCN‑BRG: Batch‑Copula Normalization + Balanced‑Quota kNN (k=48) | Praxis III | 591 | 0.4988 | 0.210 | 0.802 | 0.119 | 0.026 | 0.781 | 0.455 | 1.000 | 0.910 | 0.127 | 0.557 |\n\
    | 901 | 1 | Aletheia I - Combat + Harmony + UMAP | Aletheia I | 591 | 0.5265 | 0.381 | 0.000 | 0.279 | 0.637 | 0.673 | 0.611 | 0.609 | 0.981 | 0.394 | 0.699 |\n| 900 | 1 | Sophia III: MPB-GraphFWPCA Grid - Auto-Lambda v2 (delta=0.10, kd=18) | Sophia III | 591 | 0.7354 | 0.739 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.985 | 0.707 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.930 | 0.792 |\n| 899 | 1 | Aletheia I - Combat + Manual BBKNN-like Graph | Aletheia I | 588 | 0.3730 | 0.640 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.968 | 0.647 | 0.000 | 0.904 | 0.571 | 0.000 |\n| 898 | 1 | Logos V: Fulfilling Handover - MPB Grid (delta=0.15, kd=20) | Logos V | 588 | 0.7360 | 0.744 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.985 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.930 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 91 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-91, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research\
    \ Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
