    \ 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.744  NMI: 0.710\n  Graph_conn: 0.986  kBET: 0.790  iLISI: 0.931  cLISI: 0.965\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.744277  NMI: 0.709605\n  Graph_conn: 0.985831  kBET: 0.754160  iLISI: 0.931475  cLISI: 0.989873\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia III: MPB-GraphFWPCA Grid - Auto-Lambda v2 (delta=0.10, kd=20)\n[MPB-GraphFWPCA] lambda_selected=0.6013\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/28ef6601-8480-432a-b10e-9a6df4880db8/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 28ef6601-8480-432a-b10e-9a6df4880db8\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n\
