    Loading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia III: MPB-GraphFWPCA Grid - Auto-Lambda v2 (delta=0.12, kd=20)\n[MPB-GraphFWPCA] lambda_selected=0.6013\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/958a6790-f48a-4467-9db1-7b322396a312/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 958a6790-f48a-4467-9db1-7b322396a312\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Sophia III: MPB-GraphFWPCA Grid - Auto-Lambda v2 (delta=0.12, kd=20)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 913.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n\
    | 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 914 | 1 | Logos V: AQG Optimization 1.2 (base_fraction=0.80) | Logos V | 595 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 913 | 1 | Sophia III: MPB-GraphFWPCA Grid - Auto-Lambda v2 (delta=0.12, kd=20) | Sophia III | 595 | 0.7418 | 0.743 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.383 | 0.986 | 0.708 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.935 | 0.790 |\n| 912 | 1 | Logos V: AQG Optimization 1.1 (base_fraction=0.70) | Logos V | 595 | 0.7371 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.298 | 0.967 | 0.730 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.929 | 0.792 |\n| 911 | 1 | Copula‑DAQB: Global rank‑Gaussian preconditioner + BRBG + DAQB (k=48)\
    \ | Praxis III | 594 | 0.6711 | 0.404 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.299 | 0.916 | 0.524 | 1.000 | 0.938 | 0.933 | 0.790 |\n| 910 | 1 | DAQB Recommended (reanchor): Auto-λ v2 mean-target, δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48 | Praxis III | 594 | 0.7365 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.331 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.790 |\n| 909 | 1 | Aletheia I - Harmony + UMAP Baseline | Aletheia I | 594 | 0.4967 | 0.362 | 0.000 | 0.305 | 0.302 | 0.693 | 0.622 | 0.637 | 0.975 | 0.369 | 0.703 |\n| 908 | 1 | Sophia III: MPB-GraphFWPCA Grid - Auto-Lambda v2 (delta=0.10, kd=20) | Sophia III | 594 | 0.7361 | 0.744 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.986 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.931 | 0.790 |\n| 907 | 1 | Sophia III: MPB-GraphFWPCA Grid - Auto-Lambda v2 (delta=0.15, kd=18) | Sophia III | 593 | 0.7359 | 0.743 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.986 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.964 | 0.932 | 0.790 |\n| 906 | 1 | Logos V: Proof-of-Concept for Adaptive Quota Graph (AQG) | Logos V | 593 | 0.7428 | 0.772 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.727 | 1.000\
    \ | 0.974 | 0.965 | 0.789 |\n| 905 | 1 | BCN‑BRG (binary): Ablation of density weighting (RBF off) | Praxis III | 592 | 0.4986 | 0.210 | 0.802 | 0.119 | 0.026 | 0.781 | 0.455 | 1.000 | 0.910 | 0.127 | 0.556 |\n\nPage 1 of 92 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-92, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
