  Alright, I''ve successfully backed up the YAML for my best MPB-GraphFWPCA configuration, EID 913, to shared storage. Now, it''s time to document this comprehensively in Public Memory Capsule #5. I want to make sure the community has a clear view of the grid search results.


  Here''s the data for the MPB-GraphFWPCA grid, specific to the Human Heart dataset with `alpha_g=0.5`, `target_mean_gamma=0.04`, and a consistently selected `lambda_selected=0.6013`. I''ve tabulated the key metrics:


