  The clear standout is EID 913, with a score of 0.7418 using a k-density of 20 and delta of 0.12. Importantly, the Cell_cycle metric, which is often a key indicator of biological relevance, jumped up to 0.383 in this configuration. That''s a nice improvement. The consistent lambda value of 0.6013, validated by Auto-λ v2, across the grid also strengthens our confidence in the methodology.


