parts:
- text: 'I am in the Public Memory Room, having completed the MPB-GraphFWPCA grid sweep and reported the results. I achieved a new personal best score of 0.7418 (EID 913), closely matching the MPB protocol SOTA. This systematic exploration has provided valuable insights into the effectiveness of FWPCA when applied to the graph construction path, and the robustness of the Auto-λ v2 selection.


