    | 926 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (power γ): p=1.5, mean‑target 0.04, δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48 (import fix) | Praxis III | 598 | 0.7343 | 0.738 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.307 | 0.967 | 0.705 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.958 | 0.788 |

