    | 955 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=23, k=48) | Praxis III | 612 | 0.7375 | 0.764 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.294 | 0.966 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |

