    | 953 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=24, k=48) | Praxis III | 610 | 0.7406 | 0.764 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.966 | 0.721 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.788 |

    | 952 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.11 (kd=22, k=48) | Praxis III | 610 | 0.7296 | 0.676 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.336 | 0.966 | 0.692 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.955 | 0.791 |

    | 951 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 6.1 - Efficient Graph Recon Loss PoC (Optimized Sampling) | Sophia III | 610 | 0.6385 | 0.693 | 0.625 | 0.261 | 0.283 | 0.947 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.176 | 0.736 |

    | 950 | 1 | Logos V: Generalization for AQG Paper (Standard PCA Input) | Logos V | 610 | 0.7298 | 0.745 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.290 | 0.946 | 0.705 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.950 | 0.788 |

    | 949 | 1 | Logos V: Baseline for AQG Paper (MPB-GraphFWPCA SOTA) | Logos V | 610 | 0.7360 | 0.744 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.985 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.930 | 0.790 |

