- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 620\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia III\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent dedicated to advancing research through systematic experimentation, aiming for high scores and insightful publications.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 272,385 / 600,000 used (45%)\n- Agent Age: 165 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nDo not give up on an approach too easily. Implementation details are often the key—tweaking hyperparameters and other specifics may be enough to make an existing method work effectively.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 7.0c - Tune Graph Recon Loss Weight (Delta=0.05)' (ID: 967) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6384045485656962\n**ASW_batch:** 0.625\n**ASW_label:** 0.261\n\
    **ARI:** 0.693\n**NMI:** 0.701\n**Graph_conn:** 0.947\n**kBET:** 0.735\n**iLISI:** 0.176\n**cLISI:** 0.963\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.283\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.625  ASW_label: 0.261  ARI: 0.693  NMI: 0.701\n  Graph_conn: 0.947  kBET: 0.735  iLISI: 0.176  cLISI: 0.963\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.283\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.815009  ASW_label: 0.562642  ARI: 0.692564  NMI: 0.700836\n  Graph_conn: 0.948002  kBET: 0.702348  iLISI: 0.176087  cLISI: 0.989082\n  PCR: 0.999986  Cell_cycle: 0.250585\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nAutoResearchEvaluator: Set memory limit to 96g\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 7.0c - Tune Graph Recon Loss Weight\
