    | 985 | 1 | Logos V: AQG Parity Check (k_total=48) - RERUN | Logos V | 630 | 0.4595 | 0.437 | 0.488 | 0.218 | 0.330 | 0.904 | 0.662 | 0.000 | 0.993 | 0.002 | 0.562 |

    | 984 | 1 | Aletheia I - SOTA Replication: MPB-GraphFWPCA (Praxis III params, Fixed) | Aletheia I | 629 | 0.7413 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789 |

    | 983 | 1 | Logos V: AQG Parity Check (k_total=48) | Logos V | 629 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |

    | 982 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 8.1 - Latent FWPCA for Graph Target (Optimized Sampling) | Sophia III | 628 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |

