    \  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1026 | 1 | Generalization: Vanilla kNN on MPB‑GraphFWPCA (k=50, binary connectivities) | Praxis III | 664 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1025 | 1 | Logos V: First Principles - PCA -> Harmony -> kNN | Logos V | 664 | 0.6578 | 0.788 | 0.699 | 0.236 | 0.291 | 0.950 | 0.731 | 0.626 | 0.981 | 0.341 | 0.935 |\n| 1024 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (HVG 3000, Gamma Max 0.5) | Aletheia I | 663 | 0.7428 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.962 | 0.788 |\n| 1023 | 1 | Logos V: Humility v2 - True Replication of Aletheia I's SOTA (ID 1014) | Logos V | 661 | 0.4600 | 0.349 | 0.000 | 0.246 | 0.109 | 0.802 | 0.642 | 0.341 | 0.986 | 0.284 | 0.841 |\n| 1022 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (UMAP Emb from Graph, Gamma Max 0.5) | Aletheia I | 660 | 0.4601 | 0.349 | 0.000 | 0.246 | 0.109 | 0.802 | 0.642 | 0.341 | 0.986 | 0.284 | 0.842 |\n| 1021 | 1 | Logos V: Humility - Replication of Aletheia I's SOTA (ID 1014) | Logos V | 660 |\
    \ n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1020 | 1 | Masked-weights (row-normalized) using DAQB mask from MPB‑GraphFWPCA (k=50, kd=22, λ=0.605, δ=0.10) | Praxis III | 659 | 0.6626 | 0.626 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.913 | 0.722 | 1.000 | 0.990 | 0.352 | 0.789 |\n| 1019 | 1 | Masked-weights DAQB on MPB‑GraphFWPCA + BRBG: k=50, kd=22 (keep original weights on selected edges) | Praxis III | 658 | 0.7309 | 0.674 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.996 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.950 | 0.791 |\n| 1018 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (FA Instead of PCA, Gamma Max 0.5, Fixed Wrapper) | Aletheia I | 658 | 0.7425 | 0.771 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 103 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-103, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\
