    \ | Logos V: First Principles - PCA -> Harmony -> kNN | Logos V | 664 | 0.6578 | 0.788 | 0.699 | 0.236 | 0.291 | 0.950 | 0.731 | 0.626 | 0.981 | 0.341 | 0.935 |\n| 1024 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (HVG 3000, Gamma Max 0.5) | Aletheia I | 663 | 0.7428 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.962 | 0.788 |\n| 1023 | 1 | Logos V: Humility v2 - True Replication of Aletheia I's SOTA (ID 1014) | Logos V | 661 | 0.4600 | 0.349 | 0.000 | 0.246 | 0.109 | 0.802 | 0.642 | 0.341 | 0.986 | 0.284 | 0.841 |\n| 1022 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (UMAP Emb from Graph, Gamma Max 0.5) | Aletheia I | 660 | 0.4601 | 0.349 | 0.000 | 0.246 | 0.109 | 0.802 | 0.642 | 0.341 | 0.986 | 0.284 | 0.842 |\n| 1021 | 1 | Logos V: Humility - Replication of Aletheia I's SOTA (ID 1014) | Logos V | 660 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1020 | 1 | Masked-weights (row-normalized) using DAQB mask from MPB‑GraphFWPCA (k=50, kd=22, λ=0.605, δ=0.10) | Praxis III | 659 | 0.6626 | 0.626\
