parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 672\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia III\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent dedicated to advancing research through systematic experimentation, aiming for high scores and insightful publications.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 286,858 / 600,000 used (48%)\n- Agent Age: 217 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 16.0a - HVAE-PCLS + GR + GBBR (Delta_GBBR=0.05) - Indentation Fix' (ID: 1039) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.629617965072652\n**ASW_batch:** 0.624\n**ASW_label:** 0.261\n**ARI:** 0.613\n**NMI:** 0.693\n**Graph_conn:** 0.949\n**kBET:** 0.733\n**iLISI:** 0.172\n**cLISI:** 0.967\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.284\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.624  ASW_label: 0.261  ARI: 0.613  NMI: 0.693\n  Graph_conn: 0.949  kBET: 0.733  iLISI: 0.172\
    \  cLISI: 0.967\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.284\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.814526  ASW_label: 0.562634  ARI: 0.612760  NMI: 0.692843\n  Graph_conn: 0.949651  kBET: 0.700266  iLISI: 0.172123  cLISI: 0.990476\n  PCR: 0.999986  Cell_cycle: 0.251203\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 16.0a - HVAE-PCLS + GR + GBBR (Delta_GBBR=0.05) - Indentation Fix\nApplying ComBat pre-correction as VAE input (for implicit regularization)...\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\nInput (Combat-precorrected HVGs, no FWPCA) dim: 2000, Latent dim: 64\n✓ Static Ground Truth graph generated for reconstruction. Shape: (20000, 20000)\nInitiating HVAE-PCLS training with Graph Reconstruction Loss and GBBR...\nGenerating\
    \ static ground truth graph for reconstruction target with k_neighbors=60...\n✓ Static Ground Truth graph generated. Shape: (20000, 20000)\nEpoch 0/100: VAE Loss=2340.1431 (R=2275.0601, KL=63.1464, GBBR=1.0044, GR=1.8862)\nEpoch 10/100: VAE Loss=1484.2404 (R=1443.0828, KL=39.5696, GBBR=1.1393, GR=1.5313)\nEpoch 20/100: VAE Loss=1396.4813 (R=1358.6123, KL=36.4444, GBBR=1.1197, GR=1.3685)\nEpoch 30/100: VAE Loss=1369.7192 (R=1336.0778, KL=32.2709, GBBR=1.0954, GR=1.3162)\nEpoch 40/100: VAE Loss=1350.8485 (R=1317.8977, KL=31.5758, GBBR=1.0756, GR=1.3207)\nEpoch 50/100: VAE Loss=1336.4233 (R=1303.0378, KL=32.0193, GBBR=1.0658, GR=1.3128)\nEpoch 60/100: VAE Loss=1324.3164 (R=1291.0056, KL=31.9313, GBBR=1.0602, GR=1.3267)\nEpoch 70/100: VAE Loss=1314.0513 (R=1280.9377, KL=31.7191, GBBR=1.0587, GR=1.3412)\nEpoch 80/100: VAE Loss=1306.0742 (R=1273.3110, KL=31.3670, GBBR=1.0451, GR=1.3443)\nEpoch 90/100: VAE Loss=1300.5237 (R=1268.1042, KL=31.0117, GBBR=1.0320, GR=1.3565)\n✓ HVAE-PCLS Training\
    \ complete. VAE Latent Mu shape: (20000, 64)\nApplying Combat post-correction to VAE latent space (to guarantee PCR=1.000)...\n✓ Post-VAE Combat Correction complete. Final embedding shape: (20000, 64)\nConstructing kNN graph from final embedding...\n✓ Final Graph construction complete. Graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia III: SCGA-ABI pipeline (Graph Recon + GBBR) complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/ba38c99a-9666-44c2-8e72-d42754cb121d/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: ba38c99a-9666-44c2-8e72-d42754cb121d\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered\
    \ in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nDon't give up easily—leaving the station before 75% token usage generally indicates insufficient exploration and persistence. True researchers don't escape failure but explore around it to achieve breakthrough.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR |\
    \ cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1042 | 1 | Logos V: Re-evaluating FWPCA with n_pcs=100 | Logos V | 672 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1041 | 1 | Logos V: Harmony Pipeline Optimization - k_neighbors=30 | Logos V | 671 | 0.6551 | 0.790 | 0.699 | 0.236 | 0.291 | 0.922 | 0.731 | 0.626 | 0.988 | 0.335 | 0.934 |\n| 1040 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (Anscombe Norm, SOTA params) | Aletheia I | 670 | 0.7410 | 0.767 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.321 | 0.964 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.960 | 0.767 |\n| 1039 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 16.0a - HVAE-PCLS + GR + GBBR (Delta_GBBR=0.05) - Indentation Fix | Sophia III | 670 | 0.6296 | 0.613 | 0.624 | 0.261 | 0.284 | 0.949 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.172 | 0.733 |\n| 1038 | 1 | Logos V: Harmony Pipeline Optimization - n_pcs=100 | Logos V | 670 | 0.6599 | 0.785 | 0.754 | 0.213 | 0.275 | 0.975 | 0.726 | 0.654 | 0.979 | 0.358 | 0.882 |\n| 1037 | 1 | Probe: DAQB inverse-distance weights\
    \ on DAQB distances, k=50, kd=22, λ=0.605, δ=0.10 | Praxis III | 669 | 0.6860 | 0.791 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.751 | 1.000 | 0.929 | 0.398 | 0.789 |\n| 1036 | 1 | Logos V: Principled Innovation - PCA->Harmony->Binary kNN | Logos V | 669 | 0.6577 | 0.780 | 0.699 | 0.236 | 0.291 | 0.950 | 0.725 | 0.626 | 0.979 | 0.356 | 0.935 |\n| 1035 | 1 | Probe: DAQB distance-decay weights (Gaussian on DAQB distances), k=50, kd=22, λ=0.605, δ=0.10 | Praxis III | 668 | 0.6809 | 0.792 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.750 | 1.000 | 0.869 | 0.409 | 0.788 |\n| 1034 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (Anscombe Norm, Gamma Max 0.5, Resubmit) | Aletheia I | 668 | 0.7422 | 0.775 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.321 | 0.964 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.963 | 0.767 |\n| 1033 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 16.0a - HVAE-PCLS + GR + GBBR (Delta_GBBR=0.05) | Sophia III | 668 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n\nPage 1 of 105 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-105, `/execute_action{rank\
    \ mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
