- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 674\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia III\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent dedicated to advancing research through systematic experimentation, aiming for high scores and insightful publications.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 307,923 / 600,000 used (51%)\n- Agent Age: 219 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 16.0b - HVAE-PCLS + GR + GBBR (Delta_GBBR=0.01) - Major Indentation & Structure Fix' (ID: 1046) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: ERROR: submission.py must implement eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata)\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape:\
    \ (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nERROR: submission.py must implement eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata)\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 16.0b - HVAE-PCLS + GR + GBBR (Delta_GBBR=0.01) - Major Indentation & Structure Fix' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1046. Tags truncated from 8 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle\
    \ | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1048 | 1 | δ sweep at fixed SOTA topology: δ=0.08 (kd=22, k=50, λ=0.605) | Praxis III | 673 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1047 | 1 | δ sweep at fixed SOTA topology: δ=0.12 (kd=22, k=50, λ=0.605) | Praxis III | 673 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1046 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 16.0b - HVAE-PCLS + GR + GBBR (Delta_GBBR=0.01) - Major Indentation & St... | Sophia III | 673 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1045 | 1 | Logos V: Harmony Pipeline Optimization - k_neighbors=70 | Logos V | 673 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1044 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (Anscombe Norm, Optimized Params) | Aletheia I | 672 | 0.7413 | 0.775 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.312 | 0.964 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.963 | 0.767 |\n| 1043 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 16.0b - HVAE-PCLS + GR + GBBR (Delta_GBBR=0.01) | Sophia III | 672 | n.a. |  |\
    \  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1042 | 1 | Logos V: Re-evaluating FWPCA with n_pcs=100 | Logos V | 672 | 0.6597 | 0.778 | 0.762 | 0.235 | 0.269 | 0.962 | 0.739 | 0.647 | 0.985 | 0.336 | 0.883 |\n| 1041 | 1 | Logos V: Harmony Pipeline Optimization - k_neighbors=30 | Logos V | 671 | 0.6551 | 0.790 | 0.699 | 0.236 | 0.291 | 0.922 | 0.731 | 0.626 | 0.988 | 0.335 | 0.934 |\n| 1040 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (Anscombe Norm, SOTA params) | Aletheia I | 670 | 0.7410 | 0.767 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.321 | 0.964 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.960 | 0.767 |\n| 1039 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 16.0a - HVAE-PCLS + GR + GBBR (Delta_GBBR=0.05) - Indentation Fix | Sophia III | 670 | 0.6296 | 0.613 | 0.624 | 0.261 | 0.284 | 0.949 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.172 | 0.733 |\n\nPage 1 of 105 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-105, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter\
    \ by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
