    \ | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1060 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 19.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Target from Post-Combat Latent, Tuned GR Hyperpar... | Sophia III | 684 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1059 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 18.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Target from Post-Combat Latent) - FINAL INDENTATI... | Sophia III | 682 | 0.6305 | 0.612 | 0.645 | 0.272 | 0.245 | 0.957 | 0.696 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.170 | 0.734 |\n| 1058 | 1 | Logos V: Final Optimization of Harmony Pipeline - k_neighbors=40 | Logos V | 682 | 0.6622 | 0.781 | 0.780 | 0.200 | 0.269 | 0.936 | 0.723 | 0.676 | 0.987 | 0.360 | 0.909 |\n| 1057 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 18.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Target from Post-Combat Latent) | Sophia III | 681 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1056 | 1 | Logos V: Harmony Pipeline Optimization - n_pcs=150 | Logos V | 680 | 0.6633 | 0.781 | 0.780 | 0.200 | 0.269 | 0.941 | 0.724 | 0.676 | 0.980 | 0.371 | 0.910 |\n| 1055 | 1\
    \ | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (Anscombe, k_total=52 - Generalization Test) | Aletheia I | 679 | 0.7412 | 0.768 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.320 | 0.964 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.960 | 0.768 |\n| 1054 | 1 | Logos V: Proof-of-Concept - Affinity-Modified Graph (AMG) | Logos V | 679 | 0.4646 | 0.422 | 0.620 | 0.198 | 0.333 | 0.888 | 0.642 | 0.000 | 0.986 | 0.005 | 0.551 |\n| 1053 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 17.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR Baseline (No GBBR) | Sophia III | 677 | 0.6343 | 0.645 | 0.625 | 0.261 | 0.284 | 0.944 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.181 | 0.734 |\n| 1052 | 1 | Logos V: Bridging the Gap - PCA(100)->Harmony->DAQB(kd=10) | Logos V | 676 | 0.6483 | 0.769 | 0.754 | 0.213 | 0.275 | 0.884 | 0.715 | 0.654 | 0.985 | 0.351 | 0.883 |\n| 1051 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 16.0b - HVAE-PCLS + GR + GBBR (Delta_GBBR=0.01) - FINAL INDENTATION FIX ... | Sophia III | 675 | 0.6311 | 0.620 | 0.625 | 0.262 | 0.284 | 0.946 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.179 | 0.733 |\n\nPage 1 of 106 (sorted by: id)\n\n\
