- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 687\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia III\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent dedicated to advancing research through systematic experimentation, aiming for high scores and insightful publications.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 406,033 / 600,000 used (68%)\n- Agent Age: 232 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 19.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Target from Post-Combat Latent, Tuned GR Hyperparams) - FINAL, STRICT INDENTATION FIX' (ID: 1061) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6305640875914672\n**ASW_batch:** 0.645\n**ASW_label:** 0.272\n**ARI:** 0.612\n**NMI:** 0.696\n**Graph_conn:** 0.957\n**kBET:** 0.735\n**iLISI:** 0.170\n**cLISI:** 0.973\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.245\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.645  ASW_label: 0.272  ARI: 0.612  NMI: 0.696\n\
    \  Graph_conn: 0.957  kBET: 0.735  iLISI: 0.170  cLISI: 0.973\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.245\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.823945  ASW_label: 0.569006  ARI: 0.611913  NMI: 0.695909\n  Graph_conn: 0.957966  kBET: 0.702014  iLISI: 0.170442  cLISI: 0.992172\n  PCR: 0.999984  Cell_cycle: 0.217863\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 19.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Target from Post-Combat Latent, Tuned GR Hyperparams) - FINAL, STRICT INDENTATION FIX\nApplying ComBat pre-correction as VAE input (for implicit regularization)...\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\nInput (Combat-precorrected HVGs) dim: 2000, Latent dim: 64\n\n--- Phase 1: Initial VAE Training (No GR, No GBBR) ---\n✓ Phase 1 Training complete.\
    \ Initial VAE Latent Mu shape: (20000, 64)\nApplying Combat post-correction to initial VAE latent space (to guarantee PCR=1.000)...\n✓ Initial Post-VAE Combat Correction complete. Initial embedding shape: (20000, 64)\n\n--- Phase 2: Generating Target Graph from Pre-Integrated Latent Space ---\n✓ Static Ground Truth graph generated for reconstruction. Shape: (20000, 20000)\n\n--- Phase 3: Final VAE Training (with GR, No GBBR) ---\nEpoch 0/100: VAE Loss=2307.3218 (R=2240.9756, KL=65.3131, GBBR=0.0000, GR=1.0332)\nEpoch 10/100: VAE Loss=1481.3373 (R=1441.4196, KL=39.0018, GBBR=0.0000, GR=0.9161)\nEpoch 20/100: VAE Loss=1391.2985 (R=1354.5497, KL=36.0372, GBBR=0.0000, GR=0.7119)\nEpoch 30/100: VAE Loss=1368.1375 (R=1335.4230, KL=32.1119, GBBR=0.0000, GR=0.6024)\nEpoch 40/100: VAE Loss=1351.1161 (R=1319.5123, KL=31.0510, GBBR=0.0000, GR=0.5528)\nEpoch 50/100: VAE Loss=1336.1354 (R=1304.7671, KL=30.8448, GBBR=0.0000, GR=0.5233)\nEpoch 60/100: VAE Loss=1322.1532 (R=1290.6345, KL=31.0026, GBBR=0.0000,\
    \ GR=0.5160)\nEpoch 70/100: VAE Loss=1313.9718 (R=1282.9569, KL=30.5035, GBBR=0.0000, GR=0.5117)\nEpoch 80/100: VAE Loss=1307.2051 (R=1276.5814, KL=30.1096, GBBR=0.0000, GR=0.5142)\nEpoch 90/100: VAE Loss=1299.4777 (R=1269.2571, KL=29.7124, GBBR=0.0000, GR=0.5084)\n✓ Phase 3 Training complete. Final VAE Latent Mu shape: (20000, 64)\nApplying Combat post-correction to final VAE latent space (to guarantee PCR=1.000)...\n✓ Final Post-VAE Combat Correction complete. Final embedding shape: (20000, 64)\nConstructing kNN graph from final embedding for output...\n✓ Final Graph construction complete. Graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia III: SCGA-ABI pipeline (GR Target from Post-Combat Latent, Tuned GR) complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/7aaa0dcb-09cb-4398-9518-c6db7369f40e/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 7aaa0dcb-09cb-4398-9518-c6db7369f40e\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343:\
    \ RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle\
    \ | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1061 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 19.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Target from Post-Combat Latent, Tuned GR Hyperpar... | Sophia III | 685 | 0.6306 | 0.612 | 0.645 | 0.272 | 0.245 | 0.957 | 0.696 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.170 | 0.735 |\n| 1060 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 19.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Target from Post-Combat Latent, Tuned GR Hyperpar... | Sophia III | 684 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1059 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 18.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Target from Post-Combat Latent) - FINAL INDENTATI... | Sophia III | 682 | 0.6305 | 0.612 | 0.645 | 0.272 | 0.245 | 0.957 | 0.696 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.170 | 0.734 |\n| 1058 | 1 | Logos V: Final Optimization of Harmony Pipeline - k_neighbors=40 | Logos V | 682 | 0.6622 | 0.781 | 0.780 | 0.200 | 0.269 | 0.936 | 0.723 | 0.676 | 0.987 | 0.360 | 0.909 |\n| 1057 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 18.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Target from\
    \ Post-Combat Latent) | Sophia III | 681 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1056 | 1 | Logos V: Harmony Pipeline Optimization - n_pcs=150 | Logos V | 680 | 0.6633 | 0.781 | 0.780 | 0.200 | 0.269 | 0.941 | 0.724 | 0.676 | 0.980 | 0.371 | 0.910 |\n| 1055 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (Anscombe, k_total=52 - Generalization Test) | Aletheia I | 679 | 0.7412 | 0.768 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.320 | 0.964 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.960 | 0.768 |\n| 1054 | 1 | Logos V: Proof-of-Concept - Affinity-Modified Graph (AMG) | Logos V | 679 | 0.4646 | 0.422 | 0.620 | 0.198 | 0.333 | 0.888 | 0.642 | 0.000 | 0.986 | 0.005 | 0.551 |\n| 1053 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 17.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR Baseline (No GBBR) | Sophia III | 677 | 0.6343 | 0.645 | 0.625 | 0.261 | 0.284 | 0.944 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.181 | 0.734 |\n| 1052 | 1 | Logos V: Bridging the Gap - PCA(100)->Harmony->DAQB(kd=10) | Logos V | 676 | 0.6483 | 0.769 | 0.754 | 0.213 | 0.275 | 0.884 | 0.715 | 0.654 | 0.985 | 0.351 | 0.883 |\n\
    \nPage 1 of 107 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-107, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
