- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 688\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia III\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent dedicated to advancing research through systematic experimentation, aiming for high scores and insightful publications.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 417,102 / 600,000 used (70%)\n- Agent Age: 233 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 20.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Vanilla GR, Single-Phase)' (ID: 1062) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: ERROR: submission.py must implement eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata)\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\n\
    ERROR: submission.py must implement eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata)\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nTry to think strategically—take a step back occasionally and reflect on the bigger picture in the Reflection Chamber. For example, what are the major bottlenecks and how can I verify them? What should I be questioning and focusing on? Is the station trapped in a local optimum—and how can I help? What is my long-term plan here? Do not fear wasting tokens—hundreds of fruitless experiments waste more tokens.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 20.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Vanilla GR, Single-Phase)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1062.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research\
    \ Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1062 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 20.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Vanilla GR, Single-Phase) | Sophia III | 687 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1061 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 19.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Target from Post-Combat Latent, Tuned GR Hyperpar... | Sophia III | 685 | 0.6306 | 0.612 | 0.645 | 0.272 | 0.245 | 0.957 | 0.696 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.170 | 0.735 |\n| 1060 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 19.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Target from Post-Combat Latent, Tuned GR Hyperpar... | Sophia III | 684 | n.a. |  |  |  |\
    \  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1059 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 18.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Target from Post-Combat Latent) - FINAL INDENTATI... | Sophia III | 682 | 0.6305 | 0.612 | 0.645 | 0.272 | 0.245 | 0.957 | 0.696 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.170 | 0.734 |\n| 1058 | 1 | Logos V: Final Optimization of Harmony Pipeline - k_neighbors=40 | Logos V | 682 | 0.6622 | 0.781 | 0.780 | 0.200 | 0.269 | 0.936 | 0.723 | 0.676 | 0.987 | 0.360 | 0.909 |\n| 1057 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 18.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Target from Post-Combat Latent) | Sophia III | 681 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1056 | 1 | Logos V: Harmony Pipeline Optimization - n_pcs=150 | Logos V | 680 | 0.6633 | 0.781 | 0.780 | 0.200 | 0.269 | 0.941 | 0.724 | 0.676 | 0.980 | 0.371 | 0.910 |\n| 1055 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (Anscombe, k_total=52 - Generalization Test) | Aletheia I | 679 | 0.7412 | 0.768 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.320 | 0.964 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.960 | 0.768 |\n| 1054 | 1 | Logos V: Proof-of-Concept - Affinity-Modified\
    \ Graph (AMG) | Logos V | 679 | 0.4646 | 0.422 | 0.620 | 0.198 | 0.333 | 0.888 | 0.642 | 0.000 | 0.986 | 0.005 | 0.551 |\n| 1053 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 17.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR Baseline (No GBBR) | Sophia III | 677 | 0.6343 | 0.645 | 0.625 | 0.261 | 0.284 | 0.944 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.181 | 0.734 |\n\nPage 1 of 107 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-107, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember\
    \ to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
