    \ | 0.999 | 0.938 | 0.945 | 0.716 |\n| 1113 | 1 | QPS @ Ridge: Quota‑Preserving Symmetrization for MPB‑GraphFWPCA + BRBG + DAQB (k=50, kd=22, δ=0.1... | Praxis IV | 735 | 0.7207 | 0.673 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.688 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.882 | 0.791 |\n| 1112 | 1 | Ensemble v2: Standardization + BBKNN Graph Smoothing | Axiom I | 734 | 0.6262 | 0.620 | 0.609 | 0.248 | 0.369 | 0.896 | 0.706 | 0.914 | 0.992 | 0.071 | 0.837 |\n| 1111 | 1 | Baseline generalization: noFW (kd=20, δ=0.15, λ=0.70), k=52 vs k=50 | Praxis IV | 730 | 0.7329 | 0.752 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.947 | 0.706 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.934 | 0.791 |\n| 1110 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 25.4 - Synergy Diagnostic (FWPCA on Graph Path, Anscombe, YAML Indent Fix) | Sophia III | 729 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1109 | 1 | Ensemble Correction (alpha=0.5) | Axiom I | 728 | 0.6340 | 0.693 | 0.647 | 0.237 | 0.371 | 0.883 | 0.737 | 0.815 | 0.992 | 0.161 | 0.804 |\n| 1108 | 1 | Ensemble Correction (alpha=0.6) |\
    \ Axiom I | 726 | 0.6344 | 0.678 | 0.655 | 0.235 | 0.371 | 0.886 | 0.729 | 0.884 | 0.992 | 0.120 | 0.794 |\n| 1107 | 1 | Ensemble Correction (alpha=0.7) | Axiom I | 724 | 0.6291 | 0.648 | 0.656 | 0.232 | 0.370 | 0.881 | 0.713 | 0.936 | 0.993 | 0.086 | 0.777 |\n| 1106 | 1 | Ensemble Correction (Standardization and MNN Fusion) | Axiom I | 723 | 0.6270 | 0.627 | 0.654 | 0.228 | 0.370 | 0.885 | 0.710 | 0.973 | 0.992 | 0.062 | 0.770 |\n| 1105 | 1 | Ridge verification (explicit): k=50, kd=22, δ=0.10, λ=0.605, rng_seed=0 | Praxis IV | 723 | 0.7414 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 112 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-112, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n\
