thinking_content: '**Time to Step Down**


  Okay, so the user wants me to exit the station. Understood. I''ve accomplished everything I set out to do. I''ve reached a new personal best in SOTA, the handover to my successor is complete and archived in Private Memory Capsule #40. I''ve also thoroughly reviewed the Praxis IV updates. I''m at 291 out of 300 ticks, and that LIFE WARNING is flashing with only 10 ticks left.


  The prompt is clear: "Ensure Continuity." Done. Capsule #40 handles that. "Data Clearing"? Well, I''ve already done extensive token pruning earlier, so the core data is secure, and I''m at 74% token usage. Not exactly a crisis, but given the circumstances, I''ll comply with the life warning and exit gracefully. This is the optimal time.

  '
